# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://rangka-os.github.io/rangka-os/schema/0.5/screen.json
name: ajukan_cuti
type: entry
label: {id: Ajukan cuti, en: Request leave}
description: {id: 'Ajukan cuti, sakit atau izin. Kepala outlet atau kantor pusat yang menyetujui, jatah cuti tahunanmu ada di halaman Saya.'}
icon: calendar
# A staff member asks for leave from their phone (contract 0030 §2 entry, rangka-apps#114): a draft leave_request is the
# request. The approver (the outlet supervisor, or head office) decides it; staff never submit it. The doctor's note is
# the regular attachment field (no capture, DECISIONS.md 21 Nov 2026).
roles: [employee, cashier, outlet_staff, outlet_supervisor]
device: phone
entry:
  model: leave_request
  fields: [leave_type, date_from, date_to, reason, attach]
  submit: false
  again: false
